---A listing is what gets published into a data exchange that a subscriber can subscribe to. It contains a reference to the data source along with descriptive information that will help subscribers find and subscribe the data.
---@class gcp.analyticshub_v1.Listing
---@field dataProvider? gcp.analyticshub_v1.DataProvider Optional. Details of the data provider who owns the source data.
---@field storedProcedureConfig? gcp.analyticshub_v1.StoredProcedureConfig Optional. If set, stored procedure configuration will be propagated and enforced on the linked dataset.
---@field displayName? string Required. Human-readable display name of the listing. The display name must contain only Unicode letters, numbers (0-9), underscores (_), dashes (-), spaces ( ), ampersands (&) and can't start or end with spaces. Default value is an empty string. Max length: 63 bytes.
---@field restrictedExportConfig? gcp.analyticshub_v1.RestrictedExportConfig Optional. If set, restricted export configuration will be propagated and enforced on the linked dataset.
---@field state? gcp.analyticshub_v1.ListingStateEnum Output only. Current state of the listing.
---@field commercialInfo? gcp.analyticshub_v1.GoogleCloudBigqueryAnalyticshubV1ListingCommercialInfo Output only. Commercial info contains the information about the commercial data products associated with the listing.
---@field allowOnlyMetadataSharing? boolean Optional. If true, the listing is only available to get the resource metadata. Listing is non subscribable.
---@field resourceType? gcp.analyticshub_v1.ListingResourceTypeEnum Output only. Listing shared asset type.
---@field categories? gcp.analyticshub_v1.ListingCategoriesItemEnumList Optional. Categories of the listing. Up to five categories are allowed.
---@field primaryContact? string Optional. Email or URL of the primary point of contact of the listing. Max Length: 1000 bytes.
---@field documentation? string Optional. Documentation describing the listing.
---@field description? string Optional. Short description of the listing. The description must not contain Unicode non-characters and C0 and C1 control codes except tabs (HT), new lines (LF), carriage returns (CR), and page breaks (FF). Default value is an empty string. Max length: 2000 bytes.
---@field discoveryType? gcp.analyticshub_v1.ListingDiscoveryTypeEnum Optional. Type of discovery of the listing on the discovery page.
---@field bigqueryDataset? gcp.analyticshub_v1.BigQueryDatasetSource Shared dataset i.e. BigQuery dataset source.
---@field publisher? gcp.analyticshub_v1.Publisher Optional. Details of the publisher who owns the listing and who can share the source data.
---@field pubsubTopic? gcp.analyticshub_v1.PubSubTopicSource Pub/Sub topic source.
---@field requestAccess? string Optional. Email or URL of the request access of the listing. Subscribers can use this reference to request access. Max Length: 1000 bytes.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the listing. e.g. `projects/myproject/locations/us/dataExchanges/123/listings/456`
