---@field dataExchange? string Output only. Resource name of the source Data Exchange. e.g. projects/123/locations/us/dataExchanges/456
---@field resourceType? gcp.analyticshub_v1.SubscriptionResourceTypeEnum Output only. Listing shared asset type.
