---@field linkedDatasetMap? gcp.analyticshub_v1.LinkedResourceMap Output only. Map of listing resource names to associated linked resource, e.g. projects/123/locations/us/dataExchanges/456/listings/789 -> projects/123/datasets/my_dataset For listing-level subscriptions, this is a map of size 1. Only contains values if state == STATE_ACTIVE.

